{"suttaId":"tha-ap555","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[6031,6051],"vripara":"35"},"segments":{"tha-ap555:0.3":"Gayākassapattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap555:1.1":"“Ajinacammavatthohaṃ [ajinavattaṃ nivattohaṃ (sī.)], khāribhāradharo tadā;","tha-ap555:1.3":"Khārikaṃ hārayitvāna, kolaṃ ahāsi assamaṃ.","tha-ap555:2.1":"“Bhagavā tamhi samaye, eko adutiyo jino;","tha-ap555:2.3":"Mamassamaṃ upāgacchi, jotento sabbakālikaṃ.","tha-ap555:3.1":"“Sakaṃ cittaṃ pasādetvā, abhivādetvāna subbataṃ;","tha-ap555:3.3":"Ubho hatthehi paggayha, kolaṃ buddhassadāsahaṃ.","tha-ap555:4.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ phalaṃ adadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap555:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, koladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap555:5.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap555:6.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap555:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap555:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā gayākassapo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap555:9.1":"Gayākassapattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3798,"to":3798,"paras":[{"para":3798,"vripara":"35","refs":["tha-ap555:1"],"lines":["So arahattaṃ patvā somanassajāto attano pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>ajinacammavatthohan</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha <b>ajinacammavattho</b>ti tāpasapabbajitattā ajinacammanivāsanapāvuraṇoti attho.","<b>Khāribhāradharo</b>ti tāpasakāle tāpasaparikkhāraparipuṇṇakājadharoti attho.","Khārikatāpasaparikkhāre pūretvā.","<b>Kolaṃ ahāsi assaman</b>ti kolaphalaṃ assame pūretvā assame nisinnoti attho.","<b>Agopayin</b>ti pāṭhe kolaphalaṃ pariyesitvā assamaṃ gopesiṃ rakkhinti attho.","Sesaṃ sabbaṃ uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap555:1"],["tha-ap555:1"],["tha-ap555:1"],["tha-ap555:1"],["tha-ap555:1"],["tha-ap555:1"],["tha-ap555:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap555:1.1","ajinacammavatthohaṃ",0,0],["tha-ap555:1.1","ajinacammavattho",0,1],["tha-ap555:1.1","khāribhāradharo",0,2],["tha-ap555:1.3","kolaṃ ahāsi assamaṃ",0,4]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
